 986|      * Compute the
 987|      * <a href="http://mathworld.wolfram.com/Tangent.html" TARGET="_top">
 988|      * tangent</a> of this complex number.
 989|      * Implements the formula:
 990|      * <pre>
 991|      *  <code>
 992|      *   tan(a + bi) = sin(2a)/(cos(2a)+cosh(2b)) + [sinh(2b)/(cos(2a)+cosh(2b))]i
